id=a52sxq_zygote_next_kernel54
name=Galaxy A52s 5G: zygote_next child on kernel 5.4
author=kusti420
description=zygote_next's child (zygote::child_process::re_initialize) drops every capability 0-40 not kept from the bounding set and unwraps each prctl(PR_CAPBSET_READ) result. Kernel 5.4 only knows capabilities 0-37 (PERFMON/BPF/CHECKPOINT_RESTORE are 5.8/5.9), so reading cap 38 fails with EINVAL, the unwrap panics and the child aborts silently (SIGABRT "zygote-child"), leaving system_server blocked until the watchdog. Limit the mask to caps 0-37. Applied only when kernel_bone_machine is disabled (its k4 patch 0001 adds CAP_PERFMON/CAP_BPF/CAP_CHECKPOINT_RESTORE, CAP_LAST_CAP=40, so the stock mask works there and the clamp would leave caps 38-40 in every app's bounding set); on the stock 5.4.233 kernel the clamp is still required. Live: no_native_zygote is disabled and zygote_next runs on the phone.
